Most statues (any handmade and I think the Medusa ones are excluded) 
have a chance to contain a spellbook based on dungeon level. You can 
often get a spellbook or two from the Oracle level.

Statues created by stoning will hold the posessions of the stoned 
creature but I'm pretty sure they don't get a deathdrop so most will be 
empty.


